            <p>Properties in the 90267 area include high-end condominiums, townhomes, and single-family homes in the most walkable and beach-proximate blocks of the city. For buyers who want to be within literal steps of the Pier, the beach, and the restaurants and boutiques of Downtown Manhattan Beach, the 90267 footprint delivers that address at prices that reflect the premium of being at the absolute center of everything Manhattan Beach offers.</p>
